{"G1308":{"id":"G1308","source":"TBESG","entries":[{"source_id":"G1308","disambiguated_id":"G1308 =","unique_id":"G1308","headword":"διαφέρω","transliteration":"diapherō","lexical_morphology":"G:V","gloss_en":"to spread/surpass","definition_en":"δια-φέρω \n [in LXX for שְׁנָא (שְׁנָא (Dan.7:1-28 only); 1Ki.17:39, Est.3:13, al. ;] \n__1. trans., \n __(a) to carry through: before διά, Mrk.11:16; \n __(b) to carry about, spread abroad: pass., Act.13:49 27:27. \n __2. Intrans., \n __(a) to differ: τὰ διαφέροντα, Rom.2:18, Php.1:10 (R, mg., but see infr.); impers., διαφέρει, it makes a difference, it matters: Gal.2:6; \n __(b) to excel: with genitive Mat.6:26 10:31 12:12, Luk.12:7, 24, 1Co.15:41, Gal.4:1; τὰ διαφέροντα, Rom.2:18, Php.1:10 (R, txt.; for discussion and reff. see ICC on Ro, Phi, ll. with).†\n (AS)","source_line":1440}],"occurrence_count":13,"observed_portuguese_glosses":[{"gloss":"importantes","count":2},{"gloss":"melhores","count":2},{"gloss":"valeis","count":1},{"gloss":"vale","count":1},{"gloss":"levasse","count":1},{"gloss":"valeis-mais","count":1},{"gloss":"divulgada","count":1},{"gloss":"sendo-levados","count":1},{"gloss":"difere","count":1},{"gloss":"importa","count":1},{"gloss":"diferente","count":1}]},"G1950":{"id":"G1950","source":"TBESG","entries":[{"source_id":"G1950","disambiguated_id":"G1950 =","unique_id":"G1950","headword":"ἐπιλανθάνω","transliteration":"epilanthanō","lexical_morphology":"G:V","gloss_en":"to forget","definition_en":"ἐπι-λανθάνομαι\n (alternative mid, form of ἐπιλήθω, to cause to forget) [in LXX chiefly for שָׁכַח ;] \nto forget, neglect: with inf., Mat.16:5, Mrk.8:14; with genitive, Heb.6:10 13:2, 16; with accusative (as occasionally in cl.; MM, Exp., xiv), Php.3:13; ὁποῖος ἦν, Jas.1:24; pass. ptcp. (cf. Isa.23:16, Sir.3:14 23:14, Wis.2:4), Luk.12:6.†\n (AS)","source_line":2091}],"occurrence_count":8,"observed_portuguese_glosses":[{"gloss":"esquecido","count":2},{"gloss":"esqueçais","count":2},{"gloss":"esqueceram-se","count